        "fields": {
          "notes": "Modern scholarly Work represented through its 1997 second-edition bibliographic state, Writings from the Ancient World 6. It supplies critical translations and reference material across several ancient corpora. The 2023 Judicial Decisions volume offers complementary material. Roth’s inaccessible 2026 review essay has a separate Work identity and contributes bibliographic currentness evidence only."
